title: bug ? diff view was missing the modified text indicators
pid: 11ca46c4-aff3-4c59-9934-63fabcd3c413
body: |2-
  The title of something had changed.
  In the diff view I saw the new title, and a purple M herald
  indicating that something was modified.
  I thought we had implemented some kind of descendent structure
  to show the old title, but that was absent;
  this node was a leaf in the diffview.
